A line below an unclosed fence in a described item keeps its lazy line

```
:: t
: - ~~~
  x
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <pre><code></code></pre>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>x
tail</p>
  </dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
: - - ~~~
  x
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <pre><code></code></pre>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>x
tail</p>
  </dd>
</dl>
```

